OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fdry evening with largely clear skies,
OL,7,Fcloudier near eastern coasts. Turning
OL,8,Fcloudier across all parts overnight
OL,9,Fbut still clear spells. Cold and
OL,10,Ffrosty.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FMostly cloudy with some bright
OL,13,Fintervals and a few showers in the
OL,14,Fwest. The east will be dry with longer
OL,15,Fbright or sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
