OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,6,Fcloudy Saturday with some showers,
OL,7,FCloudy Sunday with longer and heavier
OL,8,Foutbreaks of rain which will likely
OL,9,Fcontinue into Monday before clearing
OL,10,Flater in the day. Breezy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
